{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kHTLyD5ECC1794894241.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台預測，一道冷鋒明日稍後橫過華南沿岸，明晚氣溫顯著下降。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Al2UcONLS1794894239.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>本港正受偏東氣流影響，部分時間有陽光，但明日稍後會轉吹偏北風，氣溫開始下降，周四市區最低18度，隨後再有強烈東北季候風。本周後期普遍清涼，內陸地區早晚寒冷。周五氣溫進一步下降至最低15度，周末仍然清涼，下周初氣溫回升。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iaC3SdzVtT1794894236.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.173169+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:11:50.942037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:53.665945+00:00","content_hash":"020ab299a60af4baa29af5dfa3acb7fb2d3aff5c0126c4a4d61a1c97a72166a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.173169+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}